<title>NEW ZEALAND: The Warehouse appoints new directors.</title>
<headline>The Warehouse appoints new directors.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retailer The Warehouse said on Wednesday it had appointed Philip Brass and Rob Challinor as non-executive directors.</p>
<p>Brass is chairman of Australian merchant bank N.M. Rothschild &amp; Sons and a past managing director of Pacific Dunlop.</p>
<p>Callinor is a director of Electricity Corp and Moana Fisheries.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
